00:24:22.428 --> 00:24:24.874
[law grunting]


00:24:39.478 --> 00:24:42.482
Oh, no.


00:24:49.688 --> 00:24:51.531
Oh.


00:24:54.326 --> 00:24:57.000
[law grunting]


00:24:58.897 --> 00:25:00.399
