talking about?


00:27:19.805 --> 00:27:23.116
Justin? Justin?


00:27:24.443 --> 00:27:26.184
Ah!


00:27:26.278 --> 00:27:28.189
Justin? Justin!


00:27:28.280 --> 00:27:29.884
