I'm not as friendly as the condas.


00:29:18.223 --> 00:29:20.134
Move here.
You, too. Come on.


00:29:20.125 --> 00:29:21.832
School's out.
Let's keep going.


00:29:21.927 --> 00:29:25.272
Take this.
Keep going. Walk.


00:29:33.305 --> 00:29:35.444
