00:29:39.478 --> 00:29:42.015
Yeah. Not a problem.


00:29:42.114 --> 00:29:45.823
Sweetie, you gotta go
home and get some rest.


00:29:45.917 --> 00:29:47.794
Those snakes destroyed my home!


00:29:47.853 --> 00:29:49.594
I know.


00:29:49.655 --> 00:29:52.033
