run into the snakes?


00:31:31.857 --> 00:31:33.564
Don't get eaten.


00:32:05.657 --> 00:32:07.637
Hey, honey.


00:32:07.726 --> 00:32:10.332
Hey, Gram.
How's it going?


00:32:10.429 --> 00:32:12.238
Good to see you.
Hey, Terry.


00:32:12.297 --> 00:32:14.641
