another dead chicken.


00:34:49.554 --> 00:34:53.798
I mean, what's
crazy about this?


00:34:53.892 --> 00:34:56.805
We're just feeding
steroids to gators.


00:34:56.795 --> 00:34:59.275
There's nothing
crazy about this.


00:34:59.331 --> 00:35:01.834
