Let's go home.


00:35:26.791 --> 00:35:29.670
Come on, Terry.
Let's go home, huh?


00:35:34.132 --> 00:35:36.874
It's okay.


00:35:36.968 --> 00:35:39.471
Okay, come on.
I'll take care of you.


00:35:39.537 --> 00:35:43.314
Let's go.
Come on.


00:35:56.488 --> 00:35:58.490
